            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc;  border: 1px solid #000000; width: 1186px; height: 4364px;" border="1" width="552">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 45.6042px;">
<p><strong>周次</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 200.281px;">
<p><strong>学习内容</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 91.7188px;">
<p><strong>主讲教师</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 300.385px;">
<p><strong>学习目标</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.031px;">
<p><strong>学习活动</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 196.76px;">
<p><strong>作业与测评</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 45.6875px;">
<p>1</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 200.583px;">
<p>疫苗相关传染病流行病学</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 91.8438px;">
<p>汪萱怡</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 300.719px;">
<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp; 理解疾病传播模式和流行特征，培养学生的数据分析和疫情监测能力。</p>
<p>2.&nbsp;&nbsp; 培养学生应对突发疫情的能力，包括评估疫苗应用的必要性和效果。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.25px;">
<p>1. 深入了解疫苗审评的法规、流程和要求。</p>
<p>2. 模拟疫苗审评过程，进行案例分析。</p>
<p>3. 讨论如何优化疫苗审评流程和提高审评效率。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 196.906px;" rowspan="16">
<p>学生小组（2-3人）撰写项目报告，详细分析介绍某个疫苗或疫苗相关主题的背景、原理、研究进展、未来发展趋势等。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 45.7083px;">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 200.677px;">
<p>疫苗相关病原学</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 91.8854px;">
<p>谢幼华</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 300.844px;">
<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp; 掌握病原微生物的特性和致病机制，培养学生的科学思维和问题解决能力。</p>
<p>2.&nbsp;&nbsp; 培养学生对疫苗设计的理解和创新能力，以应对新兴病原体和变种的挑战。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 268.333px;">
<p>1. 学习并掌握临床试验设计的基本原则和方法。</p>
<p>2. 分析疫苗临床试验的数据和结果，评估疫苗的安全性和有效性。</p>
<p>3. 探讨如何优化临床试验设计和提高试验质量。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
